// Zero-argument witnesses for `then`, for void apply/ functions whose only
// visible effect is a pop off the waste or a tableau column -- pop() is a
// builtin, so `then calls` can't see it, and length is the cheapest proof
// a card actually left the pile.
waste_len_check() {
  int ret_i = len((import waste));
} return int ret_i;
given apply_board_setup ():(1)
given apply_board_setup_badcard ():(1)

tab0_len_check() {
  int ret_i = col_len(0);
} return int ret_i;
given init_piles ():(0)
given init_piles given push_tab0_card ():(1)
